  "description": "Available for long-term rental, this beautifully designed ground-floor apartment is located within a brand-new gated development in the sought-after area of Cancelada, offering the perfect combination of contemporary living, generous outdoor space and excellent communal facilities.\n\nThe property features three spacious bedrooms and two modern bathrooms, all finished to a high standard with a bright, elegant interior that creates a comfortable and welcoming home.\n\nOne of the apartment's standout features is its sizeable private garden, providing plenty of space to relax, entertain or enjoy outdoor dining throughout the year. The open-plan living and dining area flows seamlessly onto the terrace and garden, making the most of the Mediterranean lifestyle.\n\nThe modern kitchen is fully equipped with quality appliances and offers both functionality and style for everyday living.\n\nResidents enjoy access to outstanding communal amenities, including three swimming pools, an indoor heated pool, a fully equipped gym and two padel courts, all within a secure gated community designed for comfort and convenience.\n\nThe apartment also benefits from a private underground parking space and is ideally positioned between Marbella and Estepona. Beaches, golf courses, supermarkets, restaurants and international schools are all within easy reach, making this an excellent choice for professionals, couples or families looking to settle on the Costa del Sol.\n\nCasa Nineteen41 offers modern living in one of the New Golden Mile's most desirable residential communities.",
